      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy doesnt really help with the actual feeling though. it's not just stress, it's like... every sound, every light, every person's voice is just vibrating inside my skull. there's no way to actually escape it when i'm awake. i feel like i'm just waiting for a silence that never comes.",
